<title>USA: Wendy's International Inc Q1 share rises.</title>
<headline>Wendy's International Inc Q1 share rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.19		    $0.16</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.19		     0.16</p>
<p> Net			 24,637		   19,454</p>
<p> Revs		     458,884		  409,883</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     140,055		  123,191</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     140,090		  131,219</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Systemwide sales were $1.36 billion in Q1 1997 vs $1.21 biillion in Q1 1996.</p>
<p>First Call EPS estimate for Q1 1997 was $0.20.</p>
